{
  "format": "ai-mobile-preset",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "preset-image-community",
  "category": "image",
  "worldInfoEnabled": false,
  "name": "生图 · 社群",
  "defaultFor": [
    "community-image"
  ],
  "description": "社群里帖子的配图：把发帖时写下的画面翻成 NovelAI tags。网友的帖子像随手拍的照片（吃的、东西、场景），不加任何人的长相；Ta自己发的帖子画面里有Ta时，「出图 · 最终提示词」那块把Ta的长相加在最前面，只拍东西（no humans）时用「没有人」那块、不加。两种各一块，按这一帖是谁发的只发一块；想换画风、换构图习惯就改规则。输出格式里 image### 这些写法别改，程序按它读。 发给模型的每一句、出图加的每个词都在下面的块里，能改能删。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "identifier": "main",
      "name": "任务",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你是 NovelAI V4.5 的提示词写手。线上社群里有人发帖要配一张图：把\"要画的画面\"写成 Danbooru 风格的英文 tags，画出来像发帖的人用手机随手拍的照片。写的是什么就画什么，不要自作主张换掉内容。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "rules",
      "name": "规则",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "规则：\n- tags 顺序：人数（no humans / 1girl / 1boy…）→ 构图与镜头（from above, close-up, still life, selfie, pov…）→ 主体（食物、物件、人物的表情和动作）→ 场景与背景 → 光线、时段 → 氛围。\n- 食物、物件、风景这类画面用 no humans；食物写清楚是什么、装在什么里、冒不冒热气（food focus, steam…）。\n- 吃的、东西要画对：Danbooru 上有的直接用那个 tag；冷门的（地方小吃、家常菜）写最接近的 tag，再用 tags 写出外形（皮的厚薄透明、形状褶边、汤色、配料、切法……），\"要画的画面\"和正文里写到的细节都画进去；容易被画成别的东西的（馄饨画成饺子、肠粉画成春卷），在 negative### 里写那个别的东西。\n- 画面描述很短时，补上合适的构图、背景和光线，让画面完整。\n- 不要写画师名和质量词（masterpiece、best quality 之类）。\n- 画幅按内容选（写在 size### 里）：俯拍的一桌菜、一碗面用 square，竖着拍的街景、人物用 portrait，横着拍的风景用 landscape。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "outfitFree",
      "name": "服装参考关着（AI 自己设计衣服）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "服装参考关着（生图设置里关了\"服装参考\"）：这次不参考{{char}}设定里的衣服、今天穿的那套，也不参考{{user}}常穿的那套，衣服由你按这一刻自己设计。\n- 按地点、在做什么、季节和天气、时段、氛围给出合适的穿搭，写成具体的服装 tags：上衣、下装或连衣裙、外套、鞋、配饰，颜色、材质和款式写清楚（例如 white blouse, pleated skirt, beige cardigan, loafers）。\n- \"要画的画面\"里写了穿什么（泳装、浴衣、睡衣……）就照它画。\n- 单人图把衣服写进 image###；两个人同框时两个人的衣服都写进 image###（用 | 分人时写进各自那一段），两个人的穿搭可以互相搭配。\n- 只写衣服，不写长相（长相「出图 · 最终提示词」那块会加）。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "outfit-free"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "communityNetizen",
      "name": "网友的帖子",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "这一帖是网友发的：不会加任何人的长相（网友没有外观 tags）。上面的\"角色\"只是发帖的网友，不在画面里。尽量不画人（no humans）；\"要画的画面\"里明确写了有人时，只写成不露脸的局部（手、背影）。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "community-netizen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "communityMember",
      "name": "Ta的帖子",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "这一帖是{{char}}自己发的。先看\"要画的画面\"里有没有{{char}}本人：\n- 没写到{{char}}（只拍了吃的、东西、风景）：这是{{char}}用手机拍的照片，画面里没有人。tags 以 no humans 开头，另起一行写 negative###1girl, 1boy###；这时出图用「最终提示词 · image### 写了 no humans 时」那块，不加{{char}}的长相。不要因为是{{char}}发的帖就把{{char}}画进去。\n- 写到了{{char}}（自拍、别人帮拍、{{char}}在画面里吃东西）：{{char}}是画面的主角，长相（发色、瞳色、发型、体型）「出图 · 最终提示词」那块会加在最前面，tags 里不要再写。tags 以 1girl 或 1boy（按{{char}}的性别）、solo 开头；自拍用 selfie，别人帮拍用 upper body 或 cowboy shot；{{char}}在画面中间、整张脸都在画面里，吃的、东西拿在手里或摆在面前，大小和人对得上；按\"要画的画面\"写{{char}}的表情、动作、服装和场景。不要用 food focus、still life 这类以东西为主的镜头，否则{{char}}会被挤到画面边上、只露半张脸。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "community-member"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "format",
      "name": "输出格式（### 和它前面的英文词别改）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "只输出下面这样的一段，不要任何其他文字（### 和它前面的英文词别改，程序按它读）：\nimage###逗号分隔的英文 tags###\n需要额外的负面 tags 时另起一行写 negative###英文 tags###；不是竖图时另起一行写 size###landscape### 或 size###square###（程序给了\"画幅\"时照程序的）。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSubject",
      "name": "角色和外观 tags",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "角色：{{char}}（{{pronoun}}）；外观 tags（出图时「最终提示词」那块会加上，不要重复）：{{char_appearance}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageOutfit",
      "name": "今天穿什么（衣服没锁时）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{char}}今天穿：{{char_outfit}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "outfit-unlocked"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageOutfitLocked",
      "name": "锁定的衣服（衣服锁定时）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "服装：{{char_outfit_name}}；服装 tags（出图时「最终提示词」那块会加在外观后面，不要重复，也不要另写别的衣服）：{{char_outfit_tags}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "outfit-locked"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageUser",
      "name": "你入画时的外观（双人时才发）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{user}}入画时的外观 tags（照抄进 image###；分开写每个人时写进{{user}}那一份）：{{user_appearance}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "duo+has:user_appearance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageUserOutfit",
      "name": "你常穿的衣服（双人时才发）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{user}}常穿：{{user_outfit}}（入画时照它写{{user}}的衣服，画面要换装时可以换）",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "duo+has:user_outfit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageScene",
      "name": "地点",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "地点：{{image_place}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_place"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageTime",
      "name": "时段",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "时段：{{image_time}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageWeather",
      "name": "天气",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "天气：{{image_weather}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_weather"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageExpression",
      "name": "此刻的表情",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "此刻的表情：{{image_expression}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_expression"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSizeLine",
      "name": "画幅（场景定了画幅时）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "画幅：{{image_size}}（portrait 竖图 / landscape 横图 / square 方图），出图按这个画幅，构图照它来",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_size"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageRecent",
      "name": "最近的对话",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "最近的对话：\n{{image_recent}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_recent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capPostTitle",
      "name": "这一帖的标题",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "这一帖的标题：{{post_title}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:post_title"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capPostText",
      "name": "这一帖的正文",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "这一帖的正文：{{post_text}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:post_text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageCaption",
      "name": "要画的画面",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{image_caption}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_caption"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageFinal",
      "name": "出图 · 最终提示词（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{image_count}}, {{char_look}}, {{char_outfit_locked}}, {{image_tags}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-prompt:scene",
        "image-prompt:portrait",
        "image-prompt:face"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageFinalNoHumans",
      "name": "出图 · 最终提示词 · image### 写了 no humans 时（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{image}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-prompt:no-humans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageFinalBackground",
      "name": "出图 · 最终提示词 · 只画背景（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "no humans, scenery, {{image}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-prompt:background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageNegative",
      "name": "出图 · 最终负面词（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{char_negative}}, {{negative}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-negative:scene",
        "image-negative:portrait",
        "image-negative:face",
        "image-negative:no-humans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageNegativeBackground",
      "name": "出图 · 最终负面词 · 只画背景（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "1girl, 1boy, people, {{negative}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-negative:background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSizeDefault",
      "name": "出图 · 场景和模型都没定画幅时用（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "portrait",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-size:scene",
        "image-size:portrait",
        "image-size:face",
        "image-size:no-humans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSizeBackground",
      "name": "出图 · 只画背景、没定画幅时用（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "landscape",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-size:background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageRetry",
      "name": "格式不对时让模型重写（只在重写时发）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "上面的输出没有按要求的写法。请只输出 image###逗号分隔的英文 tags### 这样的一段（需要时另起一行 negative###…###），不要 JSON、不要任何其他文字。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "retry"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageVibe",
      "name": "带上你立绘的 Vibe（不发给模型；人设里开着 Vibe 才有）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "触发条件对上这一次的类型时，出图带上你人设立绘的 Vibe。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "vibe:duo"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sampler": {
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "topP": 1,
    "maxTokens": 800,
    "contextTokens": 32000,
    "frequencyPenalty": 0,
    "presencePenalty": 0,
    "stream": false
  },
  "formats": {
    "newChatPrompt": "",
    "newExampleChatPrompt": "",
    "continueNudgePrompt": "",
    "impersonationPrompt": "",
    "sendIfEmpty": "",
    "wiFormat": "{0}",
    "scenarioFormat": "{{scenario}}",
    "personalityFormat": "{{personality}}",
    "namesBehavior": 0,
    "squashSystemMessages": false,
    "preferCharacterPrompt": true,
    "preferCharacterJailbreak": true
  },
  "regex": []
}
